{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfXwnqH4DQvV2sfRXtR8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this repo. The smoke tests pass, but the hook status reports `checkpoint on compact: off`, and I haven't resolved that.\n\n- **Project:** I mapped it to the existing local project `main`. It was the only one, and it was empty.\n- **Session profile:** `coding`, with the repository identifier `ufo`. There is no git remote, so I used the directory name as you said.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded `Coding Session`, `Decision` and `Task` into `schemas/`. None existed before. I read `Decision` back, and its `schema` and `settings` come back as nested objects.\n- **Placement:** The project was empty, so I stored a light suggestion in `placementConventions`: `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `sessions/`, `bm-remember/` and `schemas/`. No folders were created.\n- **Settings:** I wrote them to `.claude/settings.local.json`, so they're personal and not meant to be committed. They include `captureEvents: true` and `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"`.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills with `npx skills add … -g`. There's no `skills/` source directory in this repo, so nothing was overwritten.\n- **Smoke tests:**\n  - The open-decision query returned cleanly with 0 results.\n  - The schema query returned all three schemas.\n  - `hook status` found the settings and reports project `main`, profile `coding`, repository `ufo` and capture events on.\n  - The shared inbox has 1 pending envelope, 0 archived, and has never been flushed.\n- **Compact checkpoint:** I set `preCompactCapture` to `\"extractive\"`, as the skill's template does, but `hook status` shows the checkpoint on compact as off. I left it as is. You may want to check what value that setting expects.\n\nRecall and the PreCompact checkpoint are live now. Because the output style is on, restart the session to activate the proactive-capture behavior.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_read_input_tokens":38114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":505},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cf0cc651-05da-4541-be27-68bb809df671","uuid":"2be159a2-5a72-4ae1-a52a-c400df4ba9b0","timestamp":"2026-11-03T06:38:21.162Z","request_id":"req_011CgfXwngrWwxoTG19NgcKo"}
